{"id":"en_an-unexpected-upgrade","title":"An Unexpected Upgrade","titleEn":"An Unexpected Upgrade","description":"Just before her wedding, Yuna Ji learns that Christopher Lu, her fiancé, has been carrying on a long-term relationship with her stepsister Yvonne Ji, who is pregnant. Christopher even expects Yuna to go along with the situation. Devastated, she calls off the engagement and instead marries Sebastian Shen, the Shen family’s second son, who is hiding behind a false disability while keeping a low profile. The two make a pact: Yuna secretly collects proof of Yvonne’s plots against her and assists in Sebastian’s supposed recovery, while Sebastian shields her from behind the scenes. Their arrangement gradually turns into real affection. When Sebastian exposes the truth of his feigned crippled state to rescue Yuna, Christopher, stung by Yvonne’s betrayal, is overcome with regret and pursues vengea","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/an-unexpected-upgrade/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/an-unexpected-upgrade/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Dating Betrayal","True Love","Urban Romance","Redemption","Elite","Independent Woman"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3ai/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_an-unexpected-upgrade_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3ai/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_an-unexpected-upgrade_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dh3ai/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_an-unexpected-upgrade_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free